les done ***\\ndracut: *** Installing kernel module dependencies ***\\ndracut: *** Installing kernel module dependencies done ***\\ndracut: *** Resolving executable dependencies ***\\ndracut: *** Resolving executable dependencies done ***\\ndracut: *** Hardlinking files ***\\ndracut: Mode: real\\ndracut: Files: 1775\\ndracut: Linked: 21 files\\ndracut: Compared: 0 xattrs\\ndracut: Compared: 478 files\\ndracut: Saved: 65.76 KiB\\ndracut: Duration: 0.010463 seconds\\ndracut: *** Hardlinking files done ***\\ndracut: *** Generating early-microcode cpio image ***\\ndracut: *** Constructing Genuinelntel.bin ***\\ndracut: *** Store current command line parameters ***\\ndracut: *** Stripping files ***\\ndracut: *** Stripping files done ***\\ndracut: *** Creating image file '/boot/initramfs-upgrade.img' ***\\ndracut: *** Creating initramfs image file '/boot/initramfs-upgrade.img' done ***\\n[ INFO ] - [upgrade] - [rebuild_boot] - make initramfs for upgrade done\\n[ INFO ] - [upgradelse] - [rebuild_boot] - start to make nou entry for upgrade]\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"user_name\": \"\",\r\n      \"topic_closed\": null,\r\n      \"is_solution\": false,\r\n      \"post_url\": \"/t/topic/6361/6\",\r\n      \"text\": \"看一下服务节点：/usr/local/x2openEuler/portal/logs/backend/ 下面节点 IP 开头的日志，看看最后是什么\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"user_name\": \"Bruce Tang\",\r\n      \"topic_closed\": null,\r\n      \"is_solution\": false,\r\n      \"post_url\": \"/t/topic/6361/7\",\r\n      \"text\": \"content: image2544×1122 314 KB\\nlinks: [图片: root@gdov3 backend:# tail -50 10 16 5 105 22 task_manager.log\\n2024-12-10 09:10:48 Tue|13950:140637902685952|get_scp_client_action.py:45|get_scp_client|INFO|=== start to obtain the SCP client ===\\n2024-12-10 09:10:48 Tue|13950:140637902685952|get_scp_client_action.py:53|get_scp_client|INFO|obtaining the SCP client succeeded\\n2024-12-10 09:10:48 Tue|13950:140637902685952|upgrade_action.py:133|scp_repo_files|INFO|Start to scp repo files.\\n2024-12-10 09