{"reference_id": "8", "content": "{\n  \"topic_id\": 19145,\n  \"question\": \"centos6.9 命令行使用x2openEuler升级至22.03 sp4报错 - cat: /etc/os-release: No such file or directory\\n[ INFO ] - [upgrade] - [target_os_check] - download url list is [‘file:///mnt/iso/Packages/openEuler-release-22.03LTS_SP3-56.oe2203sp3.x86_64.rpm’]\\n[ WARNING ] - [upgrade] - [target_os_check] - download release package openEuler-release-22.03LTS_SP3-56.oe2203sp3.x86_64.rpm failed\\n[ INFO ] - [upgrade] - [target_os_check] - target os info is:,oe2203sp3,0-2\\n[ ERROR ] - [upgrade] - [target_os_check] - The target os is not in the whitelist\\n[ ERROR ] - [upgrade] - [target_os_check] - pre upgrade failed\\n[ ERROR ] - [upgrade_entrance] - [upgrade]- do pre upgrade failed\\n升级参数中repo文件路径：挂载sp4镜像做的本地源\",\n  \"topic_user_name\": \"calcifer\",\n  \"best_answer_url\": \"\",\n  \"reply_posts\": [\n    {\n      \"user_name\": \"yanzhicong\",\n      \"topic_closed\": null,\n      \"is_solution\": false,\n      \"post_url\": \"/t/topic/19145/2\",\n      \"text\": \"content: 参考这个解决： x2opneEuler升级阶段目标系统不在白名单如何处理 - Migration 迁移 - openEuler 论坛\\n另外，不建议用本地 repo 源，可以用 http 把 repo 源搭建到另外一台机器上\\nlinks: https://forum.openeuler.org/t/topic/752\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"user_name\": \"calcifer\",\n      \"topic_closed\": null,\n      \"is_solution\": false,\n      \"post_url\": \"/t/topic/19145/3\",\n      \"text\": \"yanzhicong:\\n\\n用 http 把 repo 源搭建到另外一台机器上\\n\\n好的感谢！解决了。换成网络源或者Http方式访问本地源都可以\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"user_name\": \"calcifer\",\n      \"topic_closed\": null,\n      \"is_solution\": false,\n      \"post_url\": \"/t/topic/19145/4\",\n      \"text\": \"另外，我想问一下，web界面使用x2openEuler对环境有硬件要求：空闲内存16G以上，那命令行使用x2openEuler对本机环境系统升级，有什么硬件要求吗？\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"user_name\": \"yanzhicong\",\n      \"topic_closed\": null,\n      \"is_solution\": false,\n      \"post_url\": \"/t/topic/19145/5\",\n      \"text\": \"web 界面使用 x2openEuler 需要内存大是因为：作为服务端可能同时需要管理几十台或几百台待升级服务器，消耗资源比较多，如果并发不多不需要那么大内存\\n至于命令行，官方目前没有提供命令行升级的说明吧，应该是能跑就行\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}
